  "description": "Say where familiar things are using ‘u’ with the locative case.",
  "grammar_note": "To say where something is, use u (in) + the locative form. For example: soba → u sobi, kuhinja → u kuhinji, kuća → u kući, stan → u stanu. This describes a location (‘in the room’), not movement into it.",
